<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 581)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Version moves to 0.8</b> — the same app you've been running, renumbered to reflect how far it's come.</li>
<li><b>The filmstrip is a floating panel now — move it and size it.</b> Drag anywhere along its top bar to reposition it, and drag the bottom-right corner to resize it; both are remembered. Double-click the bar to send it home, or the corner to return to the default size. Until you move or size it, it stays docked and full-width as before.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
