            <description><![CDATA[<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
body { font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 12px; }
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #e6e6e6; } }
h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 574)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: playback could stop partway through a clip and freeze on a frame</b> while the timecode kept running — most visible on longer clips and in side-by-side compare. A clip now plays through to the end however long it is.</li>
<li><b>Fixed: play/pause in a shared web review sometimes needed two or three clicks.</b> The room was echoing each transport change back; it no longer does.</li>
<li><b>Smoother while a review is shared:</b> the app no longer does per-second housekeeping work when nothing has changed, and no longer renders a full-resolution still mid-playback for a reviewer parked elsewhere.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
